Normally, I'd have a bunch of suggestions from confused
create monster to self-conversion on the altar, but with
your conducts, I really don't know what to say.

As far as polymorph ideas, I would go with Arch-Lich.
You get a decent attack (won't work on the archon though),
and you can wear all your armor.  You get regeneration,
and you don't need to eat.

I don't think Vampire Lord is an option as it would break Vegan.

Definite yes to stoning bombs, but not so sure about filling the
level with pets (do you have enough food?)

I wouldn't use conflict, since you want to preserve your pets
(mainly as a barrier between yourself and death/Angles/etc).
In fact, I would consider hitting them with a wand of slow
monster - to keep them from moving without (you *do*
have a magic whistle?).  If the Archon starts summoning
(esp if he brings in a cockatrice), then I would use conflict.

In any case, I would suggest a practice run or two using
Wizard mode.  Just to see what kind of problems you might
run into.


